        "url_W9XjdX5PzrlIof6I": "#",
        "text_MrfZH0I2uGntLi8Z": "<p>Verified 5-star reviews*</p>",
        "text_ZjKYfr3DMiysL4ec": "<h3>\"I was sceptical,</h3>",
        "text_Ald70OWqr2WQHu7y": "<h3>until I tried it\"</h3>",
        "text_TirDGluZjhacKn43": "<h3>Discover why 100.000+</h3><h3>people made the switch to Lio.</h3>",
        "text_P6YeEnH1fRYhhqeJ": "<p>\"I haven&apos;t come across something as good as this, nothing comes out, so I can use it anywhere. I&apos;m adding a few more years to my life.\"</p>",
        "text_GzBnImmE0KMDU8kZ": "<p>James (38) </p>",
        "text_IwiPEDorpjt99AOH": "<p>\"I&apos;ve had the habit for the last 30 years. I&apos;ve been on this now for a week, loving it. I&apos;m not craving at all. No chemicals, it&apos;s all just flavored air. It&apos;s perfect, really good.\"</p>",
        "text_m6wLkspAOIJ8J6n2": "<p>Anna (60) </p>",
