        "text_ZaClVx3vMwIHsUiP": "<p>Try Lio for a month. If it&apos;s not helping,</p><p>return it for a full refund, no questions asked.</p>",
        "url_gbrE9ibdXe9fIZpB": "shopify://products/lio®-journey-pack-1",
        "text_f3t0USZsCQL82gaH": "<p>TRY LIO NOW</p>",
        "text_ZkontTpKKUP4KebK": "<p>WHY WE DO THIS</p>",
        "text_tbIcHYIUFOJpDa0z": "<p><strong>30-Day Risk-Free Guarantee</strong></p>",
        "text_k6Y2ck0qSoCeFdht": "<p>Because Lio works. 100,000+ people have already made the switch. We&apos;re confident that if you give it a real try, you&apos;ll see results. You have 30 days to use Lio and build your new routine. Real change takes time. We want you to give Lio a proper chance, not judge it after two days.</p><p><strong>Use it for a month. Build the habit. Then decide.</strong></p>",
